5,1,1,talk,Servas,,We must look at the past. What happened to the last three rollouts?,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,I worry about the budget. Let us check the capital budget and software allowance.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Sakura,,I want to know about network coverage at customer plants. It seems tricky.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,I need to see the time lost to copying existing records.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Asuka,,I am concerned about staffing. Let us look at the staffing of the coordination group.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Servas,,"@Daisuke, the budget is vital, but history tells us what fails.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,"Yes, @Servas. I agree. The money source is unclear to me.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Sakura,,"@Ryuji, copying records sounds boring, but maybe it is the real problem?","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,It is the daily friction. I want to quantify it.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Sakura, network issues are external. I care about internal capacity.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Servas,,I will also check the record of cross-unit standardization efforts.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Daisuke,,I will look at vendor licence pricing versus fixed-fee work.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Sakura,,I will check in-house developer availability. I need to know who builds.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Ryuji,,I will also look at misrouted deliveries in the incident logs.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Asuka,,I will check handling of vendor queries. It seems repetitive.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Servas,,Let us see what the data says.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Daisuke,,I hope the numbers are clear.,"{""words"":6,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Sakura,,I am excited to find the truth!,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Ryuji,,"We will judge by facts, not feelings.","{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Asuka,,Agreed. Let us proceed.,"{""words"":4,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
